          "title": "如何简化多个 if 的判断结构",
          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202311/bg2023112507.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>编程实践中，往往连续使用多个 if 进行判断，这种代码非常冗余，也不易读，本文讨论怎么简化它。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "如何简化多个 if 的判断结构",
              "url": "https://dreith.com/blog/theres-such-a-thing-as-using-too-many-ifs/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202311/bg2023112507.webp"
          ]
        },
